---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const regions=[
  {title:'Asia Pacific',markets:'Singapore, India, Australia, New Zealand, Japan, South Korea, Malaysia, Indonesia, Vietnam and the Philippines',focus:'Connect regional applications, customer workflows and operating data while planning language support, working-hour overlap and infrastructure location.'},
  {title:'Middle East',markets:'United Arab Emirates, Saudi Arabia, Qatar, Bahrain and Oman',focus:'Plan enterprise platforms, integration and infrastructure around the local operating model. Confirm language needs, hosting requirements, procurement conditions and on-site responsibilities.'},
  {title:'North America',markets:'United States and Canada',focus:'Define collaboration across time zones, integration ownership, security review and release handover. Agree the support window and escalation path before production delivery.'},
  {title:'Europe',markets:'Germany, France, the Netherlands, Switzerland, Sweden, Denmark, Norway and Finland',focus:'Begin with data handling, system integration, accessibility and operational documentation. Confirm country-specific requirements with the client’s responsible teams before implementation.'},
];
---
<Layout title="Global technology delivery from Singapore">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><a href="/company/">Company</a><h1>One clear delivery plan.<br/>Across markets.</h1><p class="lead">Technology for innovators. Singapore headquarters, connected engineering disciplines and clients in 33+ countries.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap global-intro"><div><h2>Start with the work.<br/>Then plan the geography.</h2><p>Software, AI and infrastructure projects cross more than time zones. They cross systems, permissions and operating responsibilities. We establish those boundaries with your team before proposing a delivery model.</p><a href="/company/locations/">See our confirmed presence and contact addresses</a></div><div><h3>Where we are, and where we can discuss work</h3><p>Singapore is our headquarters. Our published presence includes India, the UAE regional website and a US contact address. Saudi presence is planned. Explore the markets below to plan your project, local requirements and delivery arrangements.</p><p>Tell us your market and requirement. We will confirm whether the proposed scope, contracting arrangement and local delivery needs can be supported.</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap region-grid" aria-label="International delivery planning">{regions.map(region=><article><h2>{region.title}</h2><p>{region.markets}</p><p>{region.focus}</p><a href="/contact/">Discuss a project in this region</a></article>)}</section>
<section class="wrap global-checks"><h2>What we agree before delivery</h2><dl><div><dt>Data and hosting</dt><dd>Data classification, permitted locations, access, transfer requirements, backups and deletion responsibilities.</dd></div><div><dt>Working together</dt><dd>Languages, decision makers, time-zone overlap, progress reviews and documented acceptance.</dd></div><div><dt>Local requirements</dt><dd>Client policies, procurement conditions, applicable professional review and any on-site work or local partners required.</dd></div><div><dt>Operations</dt><dd>Support hours, monitoring, escalation ownership, recovery procedures and handover materials.</dd></div></dl><p>Local legal and regulatory conclusions belong with the authorised professionals for the engagement. Engineering scope does not establish a licence, certification or regulatory approval.</p><a href="/services/">Explore all 15 capabilities</a> · <a href="/industries/">Find your industry</a></section>
</Layout>
<style>.global-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;padding-block:64px}.global-intro h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.15}.global-intro p,.region-grid p,.global-checks p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}a{text-decoration:underline}.region-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;padding-bottom:60px}.region-grid article{background:#e6eddf;padding:32px}.region-grid h2{font-size:30px}.global-checks{padding-bottom:70px}.global-checks dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:30px}.global-checks dt{font-size:20px;font-weight:600}.global-checks dd{margin:12px 0;line-height:1.8}.global-checks>p{max-width:80ch}@media(max-width:700px){.global-intro,.region-grid,.global-checks dl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.global-intro{padding-block:40px}.global-intro h2{font-size:30px}}</style>
